# L §5.1 example header, copied whole, with one ask: it loads.  An ask that reads nothing law-dated needs no
# law; its register line is the cut, the header's on (L §4.5 "K is ... the model's on date if it states none").
=== m.tally
model ul05
  tally 2
  on 2016-03-01
  start 2015-11-01
  end 2016-10-31
  note "Zasiłek rodzinny, okres zasiłkowy 2015/2016, złotówka za złotówkę."

ask q1: cut
=== expect
q1: 2016-03-01
  cut 2016-03-01
